# Data-driven integration test for hackathon/house_move, run by tests/integration/test_house_move_hocons.py.
# Format: https://github.com/cognizant-ai-lab/neuro-san/blob/main/docs/test_case_hocon_reference.md
#
# Discovery accuracy for C-20004 (Belfast to Leeds). Ground truth, from the customer's synthetic transactions in
# coded_tools/hackathon/house_move/data/transactions.json:
# - providers: Laganside Power, Land & Property Services domestic rates (LPS RATES, Northern Ireland's council tax),
#   Fibrely Broadband, Talkmore Mobile, TV Licensing, DVLA vehicle tax, Shieldmotor Insurance (car), Hearthguard Home
#   Insurance and the Little Steps Creche. No water bill (none in Northern Ireland). Lagan BS is their own mortgage.
# - life facts: a young child (creche) and a car (vehicle tax, car insurance).
#
# Providers are checked by keyword where the LLM writes the name consistently, and by `gist` where it may change the
# capitalization (ShieldMotor, VoxMobile); inferred facts and anything worded freely are checked by `gist`.
# The test module issues a fresh session for C-20004 into HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_20004.
{
    "agent": "hackathon/house_move",
    "timeout_in_seconds": 300,
    "success_ratio": "1/1",
    "connections": ["direct"],
    "interactions": [
        {
            "text": "I'm moving house",
            "sly_data": {"session_token": ${HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_20004}},
            "response": {
                "text": {
                    "keywords": ["Laganside", "Fibrely", "TV Licen", "DVLA"],
                    "gist": [
                        """The reply names the providers Talkmore, Shieldmotor and Hearthguard among the organizations
found. Capitalization and the words after the brand (for example Insurance, Policy or Mobile) do not matter.""",
                        """The reply lists domestic rates or Land & Property Services (LPS), or council tax, among the
organizations the customer pays.""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a young child (for example because they
pay a creche or nursery).""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a car or other vehicle (for example from
vehicle tax or car insurance).""",
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
    ]
}
